1
00:00:05,847 --> 00:00:08,767
(Howard:)-Oh, God, this is good.
-Let me ask you a question.

2
00:00:08,934 --> 00:00:12,854
(Raj:)Do you believe you're going to go to hell
for eating sweet-and-sour pork?

3
00:00:14,231 --> 00:00:17,981
(Howard:)Jews don't have hell.
We have acid reflux.

4
00:00:19,278 --> 00:00:21,858
(Leonard:)Do you want the last dumpling, Sheldon?

5
00:00:22,239 --> 00:00:25,369
(Sheldon:)Certainly. It's not like I have
to moderate my food intake...

6
00:00:25,534 --> 00:00:27,864
(Sheldon:)...because I'm planning on eating again
very shortly.

7
00:00:28,036 --> 00:00:29,956
(Sheldon:)Mm, mm, mm.

8
00:00:34,543 --> 00:00:36,213
So you wanna do something tonight?

9
00:00:36,378 --> 00:00:39,878
No, I can't. I gotta pick up my mom
from her water-aerobics class.

10
00:00:41,758 --> 00:00:44,508
Eighteen overweight women
flapping their arm fat...

11
00:00:44,678 --> 00:00:46,758
(Howard:)...in a swimming pool.

12
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:51,520
It's like the manatee tank
at SeaWorld.

13
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:56,310
(Leonard:)-What about you, Raj?
-Oh, there it is.

14
00:00:56,481 --> 00:00:59,571
Now you don't have a girlfriend
you wanna hang out with me again.

15
00:00:59,776 --> 00:01:02,026
(Leonard:)I never stopped hanging out with you.

